msgid "plugins.generic.proofApproval.description"
msgstr "The editor sends the final proof to the authors with a deadline and email notice; the author approves it with a recorded, time-stamped declaration, or sends a structured list of corrections: page, line, wrong, right. Successive rounds, a full log, and a printable corrections list for the typesetter. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

